omaxian-firstboot (0.2.5) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Extra apps: optional AppImages (appimages.manifest class "optional",
    never bundled in an ISO): Cursor, Grok Bot, Rebased, RustDesk,
    Shotcut, Teams for Linux. New omaxian-optional-appimage records each
    Calamares pick in /var/lib/omaxian/optional-appimages.list;
    omaxian-appimage-fetch downloads only the picked ones (into the cache,
    sha256-verified where the manifest pins one) and
    omaxian-user-firstrun copies them to ~/AppImages.
  * Full ISO: a picked extra app that is not downloaded yet is pending,
    so firstboot.done is not written offline and firstboot retries until
    the machine is online. Nothing picked: done offline as before.
  * OpenSpot dropped from the AppImage set.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:10:00 +0100

omaxian-firstboot (0.2.4) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Optional groups shipped as Flatpaks (Telegram: org.telegram.desktop,
    field 6 of config/optional-groups.list, listed in
    /usr/share/omaxian/optional-flatpaks.list). New omaxian-optional-flatpak
    records the pick (run by Calamares as the group's post-install step) in
    /var/lib/omaxian/optional-flatpaks.list. omaxian-firstboot installs the
    picked ones from Flathub (base ISO, once online) and, on the full ISO
    where every optional Flatpak is preinstalled, removes the unpicked ones
    offline (plus unused runtimes). No record: the group default (installed).
  * Podman Desktop / optional Flatpaks: one wanted-list for the offline
    check and the online loop.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:08:00 +0100

omaxian-firstboot (0.2.3) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Full ISO (marker /var/lib/omaxian/full-offline, installed by the full
    build): write firstboot.done offline once nothing is missing (no pending
    optional packages, every Flatpak of the list present, every AppImage of
    the manifest in the cache or the payload). Updates are left to the normal
    updater. The base ISO keeps retrying until online.
  * OMAXIAN_FB_ROOT path prefix for tests/test-firstboot-offline.sh.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0100

omaxian-firstboot (0.2.2) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Install pending optional packages one per apt run: the single large
    transaction was OOM-killed on a 2.75 GiB VM.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:08:00 +0100

omaxian-firstboot (0.2.1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Check the apt mirror and Flathub/GitHub separately: pending optional
    packages install when only the distro mirror is reachable.
  * An apt-get update error from one source (e.g. a third-party repo) no
    longer skips the optional package install.

